<title>UK: Cater Allen buys Aitken Campbell.</title>
<headline>Cater Allen buys Aitken Campbell.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>British discount house Cater Allen Holdings Plc said on Friday it had agreed with Union Plc to buy Union's equity market-making subsidiary Aitken Campbell &amp; Company Ltd.</p>
<p>The company gave no further details in its statement.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
